4
00:00:07,436 --> 00:00:09,909
One is in Washington State,

5
00:00:09,909 --> 00:00:11,650
the other in Texas.

6
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:14,420
Between them there have been a record,

7
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,806
