12
00:00:25,234 --> 00:00:28,605
This is the story of America's speed-record

13
00:00:28,605 --> 00:00:30,958
war, with every claim sourced.

14
00:00:31,307 --> 00:00:34,183
We rely on Wikipedia for the dates

15
00:00:34,183 --> 00:00:36,467
