24
00:00:55,185 --> 00:00:57,738
The story starts in West Richland,

25
00:00:57,738 --> 00:00:58,564
Washington.

26
00:00:58,744 --> 00:01:01,819
Wikipedia says that on the thirteenth of

27
00:01:01,819 --> 00:01:04,126
September, two thousand seven,

28
00:01:04,126 --> 00:01:07,278
the SSC Ultimate Aero reached two hundred

29
00:01:07,278 --> 00:01:10,430
fifty-six point one eight miles per hour,

