The car had been through several versions.

38
00:01:29,541 --> 00:01:33,029
Wikipedia lists nine hundred eleven horsepower for

39
00:01:33,029 --> 00:01:35,261
the two thousand four base Aero,

40
00:01:35,261 --> 00:01:38,191
eleven hundred eighty for the two thousand

41
00:01:38,191 --> 00:01:39,796
seven Ultimate Aero TT,

42
00:01:39,796 --> 00:01:42,865
twelve eighty-seven in two thousand nine and

43
00:01:42,865 --> 00:01:45,795
thirteen hundred in two thousand thirteen.

44
00:01:45,975 --> 00:01:49,186
Only twenty-four TTs were produced between two

45
00:01:49,186 --> 00:01:51,699
thousand six and two thousand seven.

46
