00:02:17,969 --> 00:02:19,059
point eight six.

58
00:02:19,239 --> 00:02:22,291
Those two numbers disagree by under two

59
00:02:22,291 --> 00:02:23,464
miles per hour,

60
00:02:23,464 --> 00:02:25,186
and we cannot say why,

61
00:02:25,186 --> 00:02:26,437
so we show both.

62
00:02:26,787 --> 00:02:28,212
By our arithmetic,

63
00:02:28,212 --> 00:02:31,220
the Bugatti beat SSC's record by about

64
00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:32,961
eleven miles per hour,

65
00:02:32,961 --> 00:02:35,019
