in thirteen point six three seconds.

79
00:03:04,540 --> 00:03:06,516
In April twenty thirteen,

80
00:03:06,516 --> 00:03:10,074
it reached two hundred sixty-five point seven

81
00:03:10,074 --> 00:03:12,446
miles per hour over two miles.

82
00:03:12,796 --> 00:03:15,401
Then, on the fourteenth of February,

83
00:03:15,401 --> 00:03:18,659
twenty fourteen, at the Kennedy Space Center,

84
00:03:18,659 --> 00:03:21,554
the Venom GT reached two hundred seventy

85
00:03:21,554 --> 00:03:23,799
